---
layout: 'layouts/page.liquid'
title: 'now'
meta:
  desc: 'What I’ve been up to. A now page.'
---

<div class="mx-auto prose dark:prose-invert mb-32">
  {% renderFile "./src/_includes/now-content.md" %}

  <div class="tabs has-[input:nth-of-type(1)] relative grid h-12 auto-cols-fr grid-flow-col rounded-lg border-4 border-black bg-black after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:top-0 after:w-[calc(100%/var(--count,4))] after:translate-x-[calc(var(--active,0)*100%)] after:rounded-md after:bg-white after:mix-blend-difference after:outline after:outline-2 after:outline-transparent after:transition-[transform,outline] after:duration-200 after:content-[''] has-[input:nth-of-type(2)]:[--count:2] has-[input:nth-of-type(3)]:[--count:3] has-[input:nth-of-type(4)]:[--count:4] has-[:checked:nth-of-type(1)]:[--active:0] has-[:checked:nth-of-type(2)]:[--active:1] has-[:checked:nth-of-type(3)]:[--active:2] has-[:checked:nth-of-type(4)]:[--active:3] has-[:focus-visible]:after:outline-red-500">
    <input checked type="radio" id="html" name="fav_language" value="HTML" class="sr-only [&:checked+label]:[--highlight:1;] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:bg-[hsl(0,0%,20%)] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:[--highlight:0.35;]" />
    <label class="grid h-full cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md px-[clamp(0.5rem,2vw+0.25rem,2rem)] text-center text-[hsla(0,0%,100%,calc(0.5+var(--highlight,0)))]" for="html">HTML</label>
    <input type="radio" id="css" name="fav_language" value="CSS" class="sr-only [&:checked+label]:[--highlight:1;] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:bg-[hsl(0,0%,20%)] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:[--highlight:0.35;]" />
    <label class="grid h-full cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md px-[clamp(0.5rem,2vw+0.25rem,2rem)] text-center text-[hsla(0,0%,100%,calc(0.5+var(--highlight,0)))]" for="css">CSS</label>
    <input type="radio" id="javascript" name="fav_language" value="JavaScript" class="sr-only [&:checked+label]:[--highlight:1;] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:bg-[hsl(0,0%,20%)] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:[--highlight:0.35;]" />
    <label class="grid h-full cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md px-[clamp(0.5rem,2vw+0.25rem,2rem)] text-center text-[hsla(0,0%,100%,calc(0.5+var(--highlight,0)))]" for="javascript">JavaScript</label>
    <input type="radio" id="preview" name="fav_language" value="Preview" class="sr-only [&:checked+label]:[--highlight:1;] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:bg-[hsl(0,0%,20%)] [&:not(:checked)+label:hover]:[--highlight:0.35;]" />
    <label class="grid h-full cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md px-[clamp(0.5rem,2vw+0.25rem,2rem)] text-center text-[hsla(0,0%,100%,calc(0.5+var(--highlight,0)))]" for="preview">Preview</label>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-content">
    <div class="tab-pane" id="html">
      <h3>HTML</h3>
      <pre><code>HTML is the standard markup language for documents designed to be displayed in a web browser. It can be assisted by technologies such as Cascading Style Sheets (CSS) and scripting languages such as JavaScript.</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane" id="css">
      <h3>CSS</h3>
      <pre><code>CSS is a style sheet language used for describing the presentation of a document written in a markup language such as HTML. CSS is a cornerstone technology of the World Wide Web, alongside HTML and JavaScript.</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane" id="javascript">
      <h3>JavaScript</h3>
      <pre><code>JavaScript is a programming language that conforms to the ECMAScript specification. JavaScript is high-level, often just-in-time compiled, and multi-paradigm. It has curly-bracket syntax, dynamic typing, prototype-based object-orientation, and first-class functions.</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane" id="preview">
      <h3>Preview</h3>
      <pre><code>Preview is a feature that allows you to see how your content will look before you publish it. It's a great way to make sure everything looks just right before you share it with the world.</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl mb-16">
  <header class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 items-baseline justify-between mb-5">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-none">What I've been watching</h2>
    <p class="text-sm md:text-base italic"><a href="https://letterboxd.com/nickcotton/" class="underline">Letterboxd ↗</a></p>
  </header>
  <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-8 gap-4">
    {% for film in letterboxd limit:24 %}
      <li class="animate-rise-in" style="animation-fill-mode: backwards; --index: {{ forloop.index }}">
        <a href="{{ film.link }}" class="block border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
          <img src="{{ film.posterImageSrc }}" alt="{{ film.title }}" class="w-full h-auto" eleventy:widths="400" width="400" height="600">
        </a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl mb-16">
  <header class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 items-baseline justify-between mb-5">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-none">What I've been reading</h2>
    <p class="text-sm md:text-base italic"><a href="https://literal.club/nickcotton/" class="underline">Literal ↗</a></p>
  </header>
  <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-8 gap-4 items-end">
    {% for state in literal limit:8 %}
      <li class="animate-rise-in" style="animation-fill-mode: backwards; --index: {{ forloop.index }}">
        <a href="https://literal.club/book/{{ state.book.slug }}" class="block border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
          <img src="{{ state.book.cover }}" alt="{{ state.book.title }}" class="w-full h-auto" eleventy:widths="400">
        </a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl mb-16">
  <header class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 items-baseline justify-between mb-5">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-none">What I've been listening to</h2>
    <p class="text-sm md:text-base italic"><a href="https://last.fm/user/nick_cotton" class="underline">last.fm ↗</a></p>
  </header>
  <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-8 gap-4 items-end">
    {% for album in lastfm limit:8 %}
      <li class="animate-rise-in" style="animation-fill-mode: backwards; --index: {{ forloop.index }}">
        <a href="{{ album.url }}" class="block border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
          <img src="{{ album.image }}" alt="{{ album.title }} by {{ album.artist }}" class="w-full h-auto" eleventy:widths="400">
        </a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
